{"name": "Rogue Factory", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/e5bdc5ba4732dd2939b8f4da47f0b262.poster.avif?t=1770207132\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/e5bdc5ba4732dd2939b8f4da47f0b262.webm?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/e5bdc5ba4732dd2939b8f4da47f0b262.mp4?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build, Automate, Autocast!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your factory build <strong>from scratch</strong> to autocast your spells!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/74f2e53630a607ed4beb56bf7f90d92b.poster.avif?t=1770207132\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/74f2e53630a607ed4beb56bf7f90d92b.webm?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enter the 20-Minute Battlefield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive <strong>relentless waves</strong> of monsters against the clock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/a6892e47c42b4300481b7891cc77a866.poster.avif?t=1770207132\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/a6892e47c42b4300481b7891cc77a866.webm?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Master the Alchemical Spellbook</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't worry, the <strong>battle pauses</strong> while you\u2019re building and browsing through recipes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/e4fc562d6efa19cb8a275ac7022e7bee.poster.avif?t=1770207132\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/e4fc562d6efa19cb8a275ac7022e7bee.webm?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roguelite Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stock up on<strong> factory parts</strong>, totems, power crystals, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/f66648e240a1426364fe052271717559.poster.avif?t=1770207132\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/f66648e240a1426364fe052271717559.webm?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Totem Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Which <strong>golden totems</strong> will you draft? Can you <strong>unlock </strong>them all for your <strong>collection</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/c6eddf12ea7c8b8246499baf660d103c.poster.avif?t=1770207132\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/c6eddf12ea7c8b8246499baf660d103c.webm?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Charms and Hexes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unpredictable <strong>boons </strong>and <strong>cursed zones </strong>require <strong>course-correction</strong> to keep the factory running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/453376fd27e79ae99094374e01678d1d.poster.avif?t=1770207132\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/453376fd27e79ae99094374e01678d1d.webm?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Arcana Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer <strong>10 Difficulty Levels </strong>filled with challenges and <strong>elite </strong>monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/da89470b3ea2acddbec51b03181ad260.poster.avif?t=1770207132\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/da89470b3ea2acddbec51b03181ad260.webm?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Complete the Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ playable <strong>characters </strong>and<strong>\u00a0100+ totems</strong> await your discovery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"200\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/c6a17347b56a1b2910c651b276b9e39c.poster.avif?t=1770207132\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/c6a17347b56a1b2910c651b276b9e39c.webm?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"72\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/a866be2f72414e7742a28d4db62366bc.poster.avif?t=1770207132\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/a866be2f72414e7742a28d4db62366bc.webm?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/a866be2f72414e7742a28d4db62366bc.mp4?t=1770207132\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock all <strong>20+ playable characters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over <strong>60 Spell Recipes</strong> to master!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draft from over <strong>100 Animal Totems</strong> to strengthen unique synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong> after you survive the 20-minute battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb through <strong>10 Difficulty Levels</strong> in the <strong>Arcana Trials!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Daily Challenge Mode!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"150\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/extras/09596aff477e4c9ffeed86843d044e1e.avif?t=1770207132\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stop by our discord to leave feedback and share your builds! (Link to discord in the sidebar)</p> </div>", "short_desc": "The AUTOMATION bullet heaven! Build your custom spellcasting factory and tear through endless waves of monsters. Unlock 20+ characters and 100+ golden totems to craft broken roguelite synergies and survive the swarm! Build, automate, autocast, OBLITERATE!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212630/7b73612c68e43272f320d9db46e780795a90d856/header.jpg?t=1770207132", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Automation", "Action Roguelike", "Survival", "Pixel Graphics", "Resource Management", "Building"], "developers": "curried_functor, ecaroh", "publishers": "curried_functor, ecaroh", "release_date": "Feb 3, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "3212630", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/E5nxq4izdJk", "first_seen": 1770073200.0, "review_rank": 1287}